    {
      "id": "reconcile",
      "api": "reconcile(value)",
      "output": "src/reconcile.py",
      "prompts": {
        "en": "Implement reconcile(events) in src/reconcile.py using only the Python standard library. events is a list (empty allowed), each item a dict with exactly project_id, task_id, seq, state. Both IDs must match ASCII regex [a-z0-9][a-z0-9._-]{0,63}; seq is a nonnegative integer and never bool; state is one of queued, running, verified, failed, cancelled. Every malformed input raises ValueError. Events may arrive in any order. For each (project_id, task_id), return the event with greatest seq. Duplicate events with identical IDs, seq and state are allowed; differing states for the same IDs and seq always raise ValueError, even when that seq is older than the final event. Return a list of dicts with exactly project_id, task_id, seq, state, sorted lexicographically by project_id then task_id. Never merge tasks from different projects and never mutate input.",
        "ar": "نفّذ reconcile(events) في src/reconcile.py بمكتبة بايثون القياسية فقط. events قائمة يمكن أن تكون فارغة، وكل عنصر قاموس يحتوي بالضبط project_id وtask_id وseq وstate. المعرّفان يطابقان نمط ASCII التالي: [a-z0-9][a-z0-9._-]{0,63}. seq عدد صحيح غير سالب وليس قيمة منطقية. state إحدى queued أوrunning أوverified أوfailed أوcancelled. أي مدخل غير صالح يرفع ValueError. قد تصل الأحداث بأي ترتيب. لكل زوج project_id وtask_id أرجع الحدث صاحب أكبر seq. تكرار نفس المعرّفين وseq وstate مسموح؛ اختلاف state لنفس المعرّفين وseq يرفع ValueError دائمًا حتى لو كان seq أقدم من الحدث النهائي. أرجع قائمة قواميس مفاتيح كل منها بالضبط project_id وtask_id وseq وstate، مرتبة معجميًا حسب project_id ثم task_id. لا تدمج تاسكات مشاريع مختلفة ولا تعدّل المدخل."
      },
      "cases": [
        {
          "id": "empty",
          "input": [],
          "expected": []
        },
        {
          "id": "separate-projects",
          "input": [
            {
              "project_id": "b",
              "task_id": "build",
              "seq": 1,
              "state": "running"
            },
            {
              "project_id": "a",
              "task_id": "build",
              "seq": 2,
              "state": "verified"
            },
            {
              "project_id": "a",
              "task_id": "build",
              "seq": 0,
              "state": "queued"
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "project_id": "a",
              "task_id": "build",
              "seq": 2,
              "state": "verified"
            },
            {
              "project_id": "b",
              "task_id": "build",
              "seq": 1,
              "state": "running"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "duplicates",
